            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# DrainBar 0.2.3

- Claude usage now refreshes at the interval selected in Settings while continuing to honor rate-limit backoff.
- Claude and Codex menu-bar meter styles can now be selected independently.
- Claude keeps a compact multi-window stack option, or can show the focused window as a battery pill, pill with percent, or ring.
]]></description>
